                                                "sense_id": "579c8a25-b655-3a70-b10e-1514c8c53620",
                                                "text": "In the menagerie of subcontinental art, the horse and elephant are most common."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b669aad3-3309-368b-becb-2e53b9df9fe5",
                                        "entry_id": "dab1b8cb-b79b-3650-b0bd-2f886e9b57cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Located or occurring beneath continental crust."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4deb66ef-7199-49ec-8450-ae0cc03e2ade",
                                                "sense_id": "b669aad3-3309-368b-becb-2e53b9df9fe5",
                                                "text": "When a subcontinental plume hits such a thin spot, the result would be voluminous shallow magmatism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "subcontinental",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
